      "source": "https://www.budapest.city/terezvaros/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Andrássy Avenue, a UNESCO World Heritage site, runs through Terézváros and hosts the Hungarian State Opera House since 1884.",
